  "notes": [
    "The Aminet 3.13 release supplies the SD executable (embedded SD 37.13), all three local helper commands and all six documents. BCWB installs SD as SuperDuper. The archive README itself describes release 3.11.",
    "The checked BCWB inputs preserve four icons. The package installs no SuperDuper startup script, saved preferences or helper in C:. The stock installer copies the files through its ordinary payload copy."
